  {
    "id": 1023004020110,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "衣装は、今あるやつと～……\r\nもし新しいのが準備できるならこういうのがいいなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020110"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0100",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\n確かにこういうのは今までに無かったかもな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00070",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bgEffectTime": 1000,
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020120,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "でしょ～？　でも、衣装って\r\nやる曲に合わせて決めた方がいいのかもって思ったから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "まずはセットリストが決まらないとだよね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\nまだ曲順は調整中だけど、もうすぐ固まりそうだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "じゃあそれが決まったらまた考えるとして～\r\nあとは──……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020140"
  },
