    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "そういうところではきぐるみ着てたりとか\r\nコスプレしてるみたいなのもあった！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、こういうのもファンの人たちが喜んでくれそうだし\r\n盛り上がりそうだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020170,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "だよね～\r\n衣装って言ってもその辺で売ってそうなの着てたし",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020180,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "事務所の物置にもこういうのいっぱいあるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、あそこには色々眠ってるからな……\r\nでも、どうして知ってるんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020190,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "この間プロデューサーが、事務所にある資料\r\nすきに見ていいって言ったから",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020200,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "色々漁ってるうちに見つけた！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020210,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "元々あるものをリメイクして使うのもありだよね～\r\n例えばこの猫耳にビジュー付けてるやつとか──……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020210"
  },
