  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0181",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020240,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雛菜たち一応、幼馴染だから\r\nみんなで写ってるのとかもあるし",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020250,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "前にツイスタに小さい頃の写真載せたら\r\n結構コメントとかもあったから",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、いいアイディアかもしれない\r\nそれも誰かのライブでやってたのを見たのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020260,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あ～……\r\nそれは、トールって人のライブでやってて",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………！　そうか\r\n本当に色々な物を見て考えてきてくれたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020270,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "なんか無料配信してたから見ちゃった\r\n卒業記念なんだって～",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………\r\nやっぱり雛菜も気になるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020280,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "へ～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020280"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あのトールって子だよ\r\n共演したし、同じアイドルとしてさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近は色々なメディアで見るようになってきたし\r\nどうして今卒業なのか、俺も気になったんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020290,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "ん～……\r\nあの人が気になるっていうか",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020300,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "あんなにアイドルがやりたそうだったのに\r\n辞めちゃうのか～って思って",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004020310,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "わかんないけどね\r\n本当はそうじゃなかったのかもしれないし",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300402/1023004020310"
  },
